  "text_pages": [
    "EPITA, the engineering school in Computer Intelligence\nSkip to content\nMenu\nBrochures\nMeet us\nAdmission\nAbout us\nA word from the director\nOur Mission Statement and Values\nAcademic partnerships\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nDigital learning\nOur areas of expertise\nLabels, Certifications & Partners\nGlobal ranking performance\nIONIS Education Group\nFrench by EPITA – FLE\nThe team\nResearch & Innovation\nResearch at EPITA\nPresentation\nOngoing research, EPITA innovation laboratory\nArtificial Intelligence\nExploration Robotics And Embedded systems\nAutomation & Application\nCybersecurity\nSystems\nDigital Transformation and New Usages\nPublications\nEPITA at the heart of innovation\nPresentation\nEPITA StartUp Lab\nMaker Space\nStudent life\nCampus life\nAssociations\nStudent support & Housing\nCorporate\nCorporate relations\nRecruitment at EPITA\nInternships\nAfter Epita\nEmployment prospects\nCareers\nAlumni testimonials\nEPITA ALUMNI\nNews\nClose\n×\nClose\nComputer Science,\nA passion\nA school: EPITA\nContact us\nWhy join\nEPITA ?\nEPITA, the Engineering school\nin Computer Intelligence\nSince its creation in 1984, EPITA has been the leading school for Computer Science engineers in Paris.\nIt prepares students with a passion for engineering to build the world of the future.\nAll our programs\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nStudent exchange\n, Erasmus+ & Study abroad\nSummer school\nBSc in Computer Science\nThe Bachelor of Science in Computer Science (BSc CS) program allows students to acquire the theoretical and technical foundation that will enable them to become versatile developers.\nFind out more\n3 Master of Science\nEPITA offers 3 Master of Science, one\nMSc in Computer Science\nand two MSc in Artificial Intelligence : the\nMSc Artificial Intelligence Systems\n, which trains high-level experts to meet the needs of companies wishing to integrate new Artificial Intelligence technologies, and the\nMSc Artificial Intelligence for Marketing Strategy\n, a joint degree with the business school EM Normandie.\nFind out more\nStudents can complete\none or two semesters of studies\nand obtain ECTS credits transferable to their home university.\nThese three programs are offered to\nundergraduate and graduate students\nwho are completing at least the first year of higher education in the area of ​​\ninformation and communication technologies (ICT)\n.\nFind out more\nComputer science and french language\nThis program offers\ncourses taught entirely in English\nby professors who are experts in the field of information and communications technology.\nFind out more\nCampus\nlife\nThe EPITA experience in Paris\nWhile EPITA is present in 5 cities in France, the international students are welcomed on the Paris campus, accessible 24/7, for an amazing student experience.\nDiscover\nCome and join us\nat EPITA\nJulien Lemoine\n(Promo 2004), CTO d’\nAlgolia\nPaul Viallet\n(Promo 2022), Ingénieur logiciel chez Dassault Systèmes\nClaire Calmejane\n(Promo 2005),\nDirectrice de l’innovation du groupe Société Générale\nJessy Bernal\n(Promo 2008), CTO et cofondateur de\nDoctolib\nEmma Payan\n(Promo 2021), Consultante Data/IA chez onepoint\nThe future will be shaped\nwith EPITA\nDiscover\nThe domains\nCybersecurity\nEXPLORE\nIoT and robotics\nEXPLORE\nEmbedded Systems\nEXPLORE\nKnowledge Based AI\nEXPLORE\nAI: machine learning\nEXPLORE\nQuantum Computing\nEXPLORE\nVirtual and augmented reality\nEXPLORE\nBlockchain\nEXPLORE\nThe jobs\nARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE ENGINEER\nExplore\nROBOTICS RESEARCHER  ENGINEER\nExplore\nIMAGE SYNTHESIS ENGINEER\nExplore\nGreen IT CONSULTANT\nExplore\nEMBEDDED SOFTWARE RESEARCH & DEVELOPMENT ENGINEER\nExplore\nDIGITAL TRANSFORMATION CONSULTANT\nExplore\nCTO – CHIEF TECHNICAL OFFICER\nExplore\nLatest News\nEPITA NEWS\nDiscovering Innovation and Culture: MSc AI for Marketing Strategy Students’ Trip to Dublin\nIn June, our MSc Artificial Intelligence for Marketing Strategy students embarked on an unforgettable journey to Dublin, jointly organised with EM Normandie Business School. This vibrant city offered a perfect blend of advanced technology insights and rich cultural experiences, making the trip an invaluable part of their educational journey. Immersed in Tech Innovation The week…\n9 July 2024\nReinventing Success: Thanh Tung TRINH (EPITA Class of 2021)’s Path from Marketing Expert to IT Leader\nTrinh Thanh Tung’s career and life experiences form a remarkable account of challenges, growth, and discovery. With a background in business English and telecommunications, Tung initially thrived in marketing and brand management in Vietnam. A mid-life reassessment led him to pursue further studies abroad, culminating in a Master of Science degree in Computer Science with…\n29 May 2024\nFrom IT Support to Strategic Management: Fengwei YU (EPITA Class of 2020)’s Quest for Holistic Expertise in the Business World\nEmbarking on a journey in academia often parallels a quest for self-discovery, where one seeks to refine their skills and align them with their evolving passions. Fengwei YU, a graduate of EPITA’s Master of Science in Computer Science – Innovative Information Systems Manageemtn program (Class of 2020), epitomizes this narrative through his transition from IT…\n15 May 2024\nPaul GEDEON (EPITA Class of 2020): Motivation matters more than you imagined\nJoining EPITA Job dating event as a recruiter instead of a student last May, Paul Gedeon, a graduate from the Master of Science Computer Science – Computer Security program, shared how he landed an internship and then a job at Red Alert Lab. He has been promoted twice so far since he joined the company…\n14 March 2024\nAmrita TIWARI (EPITA Class of 2021): “Keep up with the latest tech to stay ahead”\nAmrita Tiwari, a graduate from EPITA Class of 2021, advocates for staying ahead in the tech industry. Hailing from Nepal, she transitioned from freelance web development to EPITA’s software engineering program. Her journey, enriched by